  count to prevent immediate automatic replenishment; retain source/profile
  and use existing selection fallback. Corpse deletion stays separate.
- Render a localized, current-mapping bottom key guide for all four sidebar
  modes with narrow-width wrapping. F10 remains visible during debug overlay.
- Preserve existing keyboard settings. Follow-up: generalized Fast Action
  preset selector, controller detection/mapping, deadzone, dual input guide,
  and preset persistence.
- Preserve v0.5.7.1 combat, schema 2, Partner/T swap, pivot alignment, grounded
